        // how many groups the pattern has: `(a) | (x)(y)(z)` over "a" has ONE
        // capture, and `(a) (b)?` over "a" has one too. Only TRAILING unset
        // captures go — a hole in the middle stays, as `[(a)]? (b)` shows.
